LEGO Indiana Jones Ukrainian localization — licensing scope
Copyright (c) 2026 Dmytro Vakulenko and contributors

This project uses different licenses for software and creative contributions.
This notice does not place the entire repository or any resource archive under
a single license.

1. Original software: MIT

Original source code, tools, build scripts and runtime plugin code developed
for this project are licensed under the MIT License. The full license and
copyright notice are in LICENSES/MIT.txt.
Embedded translation text is covered by section 2 instead of this section.
Third-party code retains its own license as described in section 3.

2. Original creative contributions: CC BY 4.0

To the extent the contributors hold the applicable rights, their original
Ukrainian translation contributions, original visual contributions and original
documentation are licensed under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International
(CC BY 4.0). The full license is in LICENSES/CC-BY-4.0.txt:
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

For attribution, retain the project title, the supplied author/contributor
credits and this license notice; provide a link to the license and indicate
changes. Existing credits are listed in README.md and the relevant asset
documentation. This license does not imply endorsement of modified versions.

3. Excluded third-party materials and rights

The licenses above grant only rights held by the project contributors. They
do not relicense LEGO Indiana Jones: The Original Adventures, its original
texts, artwork, textures, fonts, music, video, code or other game resources.
Game-derived or donor-derived resources may contain third-party material;
only the contributors' own licensable contributions are covered by section 2.
No blanket CC BY or MIT license is granted for a complete UAP, DAT, FNT, DDS,
GSC or other mixed resource file. Original font designs, donor localization
materials, trademarks and other third-party rights remain with their
respective rights holders. These licenses do not supply missing permissions
to use or redistribute such material.

Ultimate ASI Loader and its included third-party components retain their own
licenses. Their full notices are preserved in:
native/vendor/ultimate-asi-loader-v9.7.4/LICENSE.txt
In the game bundle: scripts/UKRAINIAN/LICENSE-ASI-Loader.txt

Bundled third-party code, tools and other materials with their own notices
are excluded from the project's MIT and CC BY grants.

4. Distribution layout

The repository and source archive include this notice and LICENSES/.
The game bundle includes the same notice and both full project license texts
in scripts/UKRAINIAN/LICENSE.txt, alongside LICENSE-ASI-Loader.txt.
